From 353891eb2b29b58c9467061577429e00b3c2cb27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 11:18:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD selected-agent slash command dispatch so slash input
 avoids ordinary prompts

Selected-agent chat input that begins with a slash is parsed into a backend command and routed through the provider command API. Codex resumes the existing thread with the slash command text, so commands such as /status do not run through the normal prompted agent-message path.
